OL,3,GNEWSANI employers named for not paying
OL,4,Astaff minimum wage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThirty-six businesses in Northern
OL,7,FIreland, including a care provider,
OL,8,Fhotels and solicitors, have been named
OL,9,Ffor failing to pay their employees the
OL,10,Fminimum wage, according to the
OL,11,FDepartment for Business and Trade
OL,12,F(DBT).
OL,14,FAcross the UK, more than 600 employers
OL,15,Fwere ordered to pay affected workers
OL,16,Fthe outstanding wages, with #4m
OL,17,Freturned to workers.
OL,19,FThe firms across the UK have also been
OL,20,Fissued penalties worth #7m.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
